  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Soudan - Approvisionnement en eau de Port Soudan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan - Port Sudan Water Supply</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project would involve :  - Construction of pumping stations and reservoir at Dolabiai ;  - Construction of about 80 kms presure pipeline between Dolabiai and crest reservoir;  - Construction of about 75 kms gravity pipeline between crest reservoir and port sudan&apos;s network system ;  - Rehabilitation network in port sudan ;  - Equipement for communication and regulation between the well-field and water-work ;  -Organisation of hydrological data collection and low cost sanitation measures .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
